      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        462.2420349121094,
        247.6328582763672,
        473.0129089355469
      ],
      "text": "a  Studies are sorted by decreasing sensitivity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        491.5288391113281,
        281.777587890625,
        507.9088134765625
      ],
      "text": "Detection of extrapulmonary TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        519.143310546875,
        504.0782775878906,
        533.2312622070312
      ],
      "text": "Should LC-aNAATs on lymph node fluid be used to diagnose lymph node TB in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        533.54345703125,
        506.8863220214844,
        547.6314086914062
      ],
      "text": "adults and adolescents with signs and symptoms of lymph node TB, against an",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        547.9434204101562,
        101.89099884033203,
        562.0313720703125
      ],
      "text": "MRS?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        572.6983032226562,
        527.1161499023438,
        585.8433227539062
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAAT summary sensitivity and specificity from nine Xpert Ultra studies (445 participants) to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.959224700927734,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        588.1983032226562,
        526.6205444335938,
        601.3433227539062
      ],
      "text": "diagnose lymph node TB in lymph node fluid in adults and adolescents with signs and symptoms",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        603.6983032226562,
        526.7589111328125,
        616.8433227539062
      ],
      "text": "of lymph node TB ( ) were 85.3% (95% CI: 73.4–92.4) and 74.1% (95% CI: 63.5–82.5),  Fig. 2.1.4",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995199203491211,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        619.1983032226562,
        526.964599609375,
        632.3433227539062
      ],
      "text": "respectively. The certainty of evidence was low for sensitivity and very low for specificity. Only",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        634.6983032226562,
        526.97265625,
        647.8433227539062
      ],
      "text": "data on Xpert Ultra were included in the evaluation to answer this PICO question. The diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        650.1983032226562,
        526.9260864257812,
        663.3433227539062
      ],
      "text": "accuracy of LC-aNAATs against a composite reference standard (CRS) that comprised the MRS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        665.6983032226562,
        526.9049072265625,
        678.8433227539062
      ],
      "text": "plus patients who received clinical diagnoses (but were bacteriologically unconfirmed) was also",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.961081504821777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        681.1983032226562,
        526.89794921875,
        694.3433227539062
      ],
      "text": "considered. The use of the CRS markedly increased specificity to 97.4% (95% CI: 82.2–99.7) but",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97692584991455,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        696.6983032226562,
        526.964599609375,
        709.8433227539062
      ],
      "text": "decreased sensitivity to 71.3% (95% CI: 64.3–77.4), highlighting the known challenges with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        712.1983032226562,
        526.9467163085938,
        725.3433227539062
      ],
      "text": "culture-based confirmation of TB with this sample type (see  ). Data on Truenat  Web Annex B.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984389305114746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.6983032226562,
        272.4713439941406,
        740.8433227539062
      ],
      "text": "were limited and thus were not included.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
